over:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a><a href="/points/acupressure-points" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">ST12</div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">ST12 (Quepen)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Empty Basin</span></h3><div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★☆</div><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Cough, hiccups, chest pain</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a><a href="/points/acupressure-points" class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 transition-all hover:border-emerald-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:hover:border-emerald-600"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold">LU2</div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><h3 class="font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">LU2 (Yunmen)<span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500 font-normal"> · Cloud Gate</span></h3><div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★☆</div><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Cough, asthma, shoulder tension</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a></div><div class="text-center mt-10"><a href="/atlas" class="inline-flex items-ce